  "body": "## Result\nFor PR1224\u2019s fixed A7 weights + A1 root nine-normal decoder on P120, prove the sharp separate COPY cost **72** over arbitrary independent complex per-root shifts. An all-nine-active exact witness attains ranks `(1,8,9,9,9,9,9,9,9)`.\n\nThe rank-shape corollary is also sharp for every `0<q<=1`: minimum separate COPY power is `8*9^q` with zero terms allowed, and `1+8^q+7*9^q` with all nine active. At q<1 the active overcomplete family is strictly worse than the eight-term P120 comparator. These are COPY power sums, not a full recursive supplier moment.\n\n## Evidence and novelty\n- Complete 43,435-plane binary deficiency census; 304,045 direct annihilator cross-checks.\n- A forced rank-nine A1 term, eight mutable deficiency spaces, and a written all-complex-shift proof: each partner space has dimension at most one; reverse forced spaces have rank one or seven; seven rank-one root labels are independent.\n- Exact rational isometry and 120-root bijection bind the canonical model to PR1224\u2019s actual normals.\n- S8 generator covariance, two full 14,400-entry attaining identities, complete separate invoices, and meaningful source/receipt/semantic corruption controls.\n- PR1224 supplied this candidate and heuristic cost81, not its optimum. PR1248\u2019s deficiency-plane method is explicitly credited; its A8 nine-way dependency is a different family and its extra incompatibility lemma is not assumed here.\n\nIndependent seed `cf5042788fae24418be429f5a4587f5d`, complex-mechanisms, task complex-rank-shape-decoder. Base `e112d71c8d7bb32435debcc54df932593dd8223a`. Scope explicitly changed from physical synthesis to a source-proposed exact obstruction. Package: `research/a7-a1-decoder-floor/`.\n\n## Validation\nOn CPython3.12.12: direct focused replay passed; five optimized tests passed; registered replay passed with outcome=negative-result. Parent independently reviewed the proof/source binding and reran the registered replay before granting publication. Reproduce:\n\n```\nuv run --python 3.12 --no-project python scripts/research_package.py --package research/a7-a1-decoder-floor\n```\n\nExpected: `PASS_A7_A1_DECODER_FLOOR` with COPY72, 43435planes and304045directchecks; five tests OK; `PASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE`.\n\n## Limits and credit\nNo physical decoder, fully paid child profile, supplier admission, kappa improvement, formal-kernel theorem, independent human review, or hosted-CI pass is claimed. Selected frontier and frozen sources are unchanged. Credit joaqcoo/PR1224, Philipp/mightyOil/PR1248, DreamingOfClouds/PR717/446/595 and the retained E8/selected-supplier lineage. Prepared for Adam Gall with substantial OpenAI Codex GPT-6 Astra assistance; Apache-2.0.\n\nCoordination: #research-claim-and-completion-record\n\n## Research claim and completion record\n\nStatus: completed. The claim record is preserved here so this PR is self-contained. Historical coordination links in the committed research metadata refer to this record; the separate coordination discussion is being removed.\n\nDONE \u2014 [PR #2062](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2062), full commit `8344a5fc1eb643aca6a21bc745d824a38f449e39`. Sharp COPY72 for the fixed A7 weights + A1 root nine-normal P120 family over arbitrary complex row shifts; all-nine-active ranks `(1,8,9,9,9,9,9,9,9)`. The exact separate-power minima are `8*9^q` with zeros allowed and `1+8^q+7*9^q` with all nine active, for0<q<=1. Complete43435-plane deficiency census,304045 direct annihilator cross-checks, exact source isometry, S8 covariance and full all-pairs attainments. CPython3.12.12 focused/registered replay and5 optimized tests pass; parent independently reviewed/replayed and granted publication. No physical supplier, full recursive moment, kappa improvement, formal-kernel proof or hostedCI pass claimed. Package `research/a7-a1-decoder-floor`.\n\nOriginal CLAIM \u2014 seed `cf5042788fae24418be429f5a4587f5d`; base `e112d71c8d7bb32435debcc54df932593dd8223a`. Object: PR1224 fixed A7+A1 decoder on P120, arbitrary independent complex per-root shifts along its eight-term dependency. Aim: exact separate-COPY optimum replacing heuristic cost81, not enlarging a sampled box. Changed scope from physical rank-shape synthesis to a useful exact obstruction. PR1248 A8 simplex has nine dependent normals; different geometry. Initial A2+E6 idea was abandoned before computation on collision notice. Credit joaqcoo/PR1224, Philipp/mightyOil/PR1248, DreamingOfClouds and the retained E8 lineage. Substantial OpenAI Codex GPT-6 Astra assistance; Apache-2.0. Claim released as completed.\n",
